<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>
  <!-- Compatibility seals for known third-party apparel that Contagion can't infer well from stats
       (design §3.5 rule 2). Each operation MUST guard with PatchOperationFindMod (the source mod) AND
       only apply when the item author hasn't already shipped their own protection, so rule 1 always wins:

         <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="SomeModdedSuit"
                  and not(modExtensions/li[@Class="Contagion.ApparelContagionProtection"])]</xpath>

       Most modded spacer armor already "just works" via the tech-level fallback (Spacer + VacuumResistance/
       ToxEnv taken at face value), so entries here are only for gear the heuristic misjudges.

       No third-party entries yet — intentionally empty, kept to document the convention. -->
</Patch>
